  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nWe need to find which expression equals 0.\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nArithmetic operations\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nLet's calculate each option:\n\n1) ⇒ (2 × 3 + 5 - (1 - 2(3 - 2 × 2)))\n\n⇒ 6 + 5 - (1 - 2(3 - 4))\n\n⇒ 11 - (1 - 2(-1))\n\n⇒ 11 - (1 + 2)\n\n⇒ 11 - 3\n\n⇒ 8\n\n2) ⇒ (2 × 3 - 5 - (1 + 2(3 - 2 × 2)))\n\n⇒ 6 - 5 - (1 + 2(3 - 4))\n\n⇒ 1 - (1 + 2(-1))\n\n⇒ 1 - (1 - 2)\n\n⇒ 1 - (-1)\n\n⇒ 2\n\n3) ⇒ (2 × 3 - 5 + (1 + 2(3 - 2 × 2)))\n\n⇒ 6 - 5 + (1 + 2(3 - 4))\n\n⇒ 1 + (1 + 2(-1))\n\n⇒ 1 + (1 - 2)\n\n⇒ 1 - 1\n\n⇒ 0\n\n4) ⇒ (2 × 3 - 5 - (1 - 2(3 - 2 × 2)))\n\n⇒ 6 - 5 - (1 - 2(3 - 4))\n\n⇒ 1 - (1 - 2(-1))\n\n⇒ 1 - (1 + 2)\n\n⇒ 1 - 3\n\n⇒ -2\n\n**The expression that has a value equal to 0 is option 3.**",
